  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Counter Violent Extremism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deny terrorist organizations, particularly al-Qaida (AQ) and its affiliates, potential new recruits by: providing positive alternatives to those most at-risk of recruitment into violent extremism; countering the AQ ideology, which glorifies violence; and increasing partner capacity, both civil society and government, to stem terrorist recruitment.</narrative>
  </description>
